      en: ["The peninsula is approximately 15 kilometers long.", "The highest peak is Maja e Koretës at 826 meters.", "Contains the Haxhi Ali Cave, Albania's largest sea cave.", "Part of the first Marine National Park since 2010.", "Grama Bay features ancient inscriptions from sailors.", "Habitat for the rare Mediterranean monk seal."],
